-- A range loop after a terminator cannot execute. This header has no authored step and no
-- ordinal binding, so lowering emits no generated range check; the skipped-source evidence
-- walker must not select a fast range guard for a shape that is accepted when it is live.
$fast_math $safe_math
dead_unstepped |limit I32| -> I32:
    return 0
    loop 0 to limit:
    ;
;
